WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:09.310
Part eighteen: family manager requests. Approve or decline a parent who asked to manage their family's volunteer credit.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.913
Hub tools shows how many requests are waiting.

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:15.790
Tap Family manager requests.

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:23.809
When payouts start, the family manager decides how the family's share is split between their students. One per family.

00:00:24.009 --> 00:00:27.060
Each request shows who asked, and for which students.

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:31.390
Tap Approve, or Decline. Decline takes a second tap.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:34.790
Saved with your name and the date.
